    "detailed_description": "Hen Town is a rogue-like game, exploring randomly generated maps, fighting against monsters.In this game, you transform into a powerful female knight, bearing a heavy and brave responsibility. Your mission is to fight ceaselessly against terrifying monsters, using skills and weapons to defeat them, protecting village and its inhabitants from devastation and threats posed by these malevolent creatures, bringing back light and hope to the entire village.<br />\r\nAs you progress in the game, you can unlock permanent upgrades, enhancing your abilities and mastering the skill of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Feature :<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHen Town features captivating anime characters, enhanced with high-quality 3D graphics. <br />\r\nThe game includes endlessly created maps without borders, ensuring smooth gameplay even with numerous monsters displayed. <br />\r\nIt offers a simple yet engaging survival experience with elements of roguelite.<br />\r\nMany upgrades for the main character.<br />\r\nvariety of achievements to unlock.",
